Default native 60 to 200% virtual CPU and add confirmed overlay Quit.

Fresh launcher profiles already expose the full 100-200% virtual-CPU ladder.
Start at its supported maximum when native 60 is enabled, and use the same
default for direct runtime launches that omit PSX_CRASH2_60FPS_CPU_PCT.

Add QUIT GAME after Restart in the Home overlay. Both process-level actions
share a two-press confirmation state which is cancelled by moving away. Quit
uses shutdown_runtime before exit, so memory cards/captures flush and the audio,
controller, debug, netplay and background compiler resources shut down in the
same order as a normal window close.

